# Keep the image lean: only the runtime modules (throttle/draft_guard/wrapper) and
# the optional auth/ package need to reach /opt/xmcp. Everything below is build- or
# docs-only. NB: never ignore auth/ — it is the C-2 chat-auth package loaded at boot.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
# Ignore stray .patch files to keep the image lean, but RE-INCLUDE the two the
# Dockerfile COPYs at build time — without these the build dies at the COPY step
# ("/relax-response-required.patch: not found"). See EPIC-2.4 #635.
*.patch
!headless-oauth1.patch
!relax-response-required.patch
docker-compose.callisthenes.yml
.env.example
.env
README.md
SEAM-SURFACE.md
test_*.py
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
